  phoneLogs:
  - ' .Hey voice comes right?.Finally this shit can is working.Listen I got some
    news from that weird guy who gave us this job. Well apparently the statue behind
    the car is cursed. And we all will be doomed.(Laughs) There are really crazy
    people in the world. Well just be faster. You need to be here at least this morning.
    I am going to be awake all night.This crazy guy talking shit and wants me to
    listen.Just be faster man'
  - ' .(Yeah yeah I''am telling him as you see).Hey this guy insisted me to tell
    you some crazy fantasy knowledge. He says that animals will act different because
    of the statue.(freak).also humans may appear from nowhere.And if you see an animal
    focused to you. do not use front lights in strong mode. They will begin to appear
    more. And also when you see a human.in a middle of some road. don''t open interior
    light. They would do the same. Thank you for listening this nonsense ad. .(I
    should have finisihed college)'
  - ' .H-Hey man (uhm) my voice comes right?. Listen, I wouldn''t want to believe
    this guy but he disappeared in front of my eyes. Be careful. This thing may be
    cursed. I-I now you wouldn''t believe me b-but. .Just be careful. There will
    be some, crazy shit happen'
